(eval/, see eval/LICENSES.md) and the training data (train/data/, see
train/DATA_LICENSES.md). Each row keeps its source and license fields.

deepset/prompt-injections
  deepset GmbH. Apache License 2.0 (the card also lists CC-BY-4.0).
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/deepset/prompt-injections

Lakera/gandalf_ignore_instructions
  Lakera AI. MIT License.
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/Lakera/gandalf_ignore_instructions

jackhhao/jailbreak-classification
  Jack Hao. Apache License 2.0. Its prompts derive from
  verazuo/jailbreak_llms (MIT), OpenOrca (MIT) and GPTeacher (MIT).
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/jackhhao/jailbreak-classification

OpenAssistant/oasst2
  The OpenAssistant contributors. Apache License 2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenAssistant/oasst2

